/*
ZENTRY GOLD MATRIX EA V1 — DESIGN OVERVIEW

Developed by: Anton Benny | Zentry Developers
Contact: zentry.dev01@gmail.com

This Expert Advisor is an original structured trading system for MetaTrader 5,
designed exclusively for gold (XAUUSD). It implements a five-zone session routing
architecture where each zone operates an independent position group with its own
entry conditions, layering logic, and exit management.

Identity:
- EA name: Zentry Gold Matrix EA V1
- Instrument: GOLD / XAUUSD family. Chart timeframe is irrelevant; all data is
  managed internally across M1 / M5 / M15 / H1.
- Internal data: M1 for timing and candle microstructure, M5/M15 for directional
  regime and slope, H1 for trend alignment filter.

Zone behavior:
- ZA/W01: Late-session dominant BUY-side mean-reversion zone.
  Active 22:15-23:59 and midnight wrap 00:58-01:05. Targets lower-wick rejections
  and compressed pullbacks. Layers on adverse movement; exits the full position
  group at weighted-average-plus-buffer or at a defined profit threshold.
- ZB/W03: Late US-session BUY-side hybrid zone.
  Active 22:00-22:59. Targets constructive pullbacks and bullish expansion at the
  US-Asia transition. Selective entry count; can layer when setup persists.
- ZC/W04: New York open BUY-biased impulse zone.
  Active 19:00-19:59. Targets bullish impulse and pullback continuation. Typically
  produces single or dual-position groups.
- ZD/W09: Mid-session opportunistic BUY-side cadence zone.
  Active 10:00-14:15; Thursday/Friday bias only. Uses a time-cadence gate with
  compression and structure filters. Produces short-hold single or dual groups.
- ZE/W12: London morning SELL-side reversal zone.
  Active 08:20-10:05. Targets upper-wick exhaustion and early-session bearish
  reaction. Widest layer spacing. Day-quality filter penalises Wednesday/Friday.

Position group model:
- Each zone owns one independent position group state.
- Orders tagged: ZGM[symbol][magic][zone]#G[group_id]
- Lot sizing: balance-block scaled 0.01 per 500 balance units, capped by
  InpAutoLotsValue. Not multiplied on loss (not martingale).
- Exits are synchronised group closes. Individual TP/SL optional.
- Escape logic: max age, adverse points, per-group loss, global floating loss,
  drawdown mode, equity protection, session-end flattening.
- Controlled exit: age and session limit exits use safe-close logic — holds near
  average or at a small controlled loss rather than crystallising a recovering group.

Calibrated parameter values:
  ZA/W01: 22:15-23:59 + 00:58-01:05, maxPositions=4, entryMin=4.80, bufferPts=82, layerGap=230, maxAge=240min, flatten=0
  ZB/W03: 22:00-22:59, maxPositions=5, entryMin=5.00, bufferPts=104, layerGap=215, maxAge=150min, flatten=0
  ZC/W04: 19:00-19:59, maxPositions=4, entryMin=4.20, bufferPts=105, layerGap=195, maxAge=110min, flatten=0
  ZD/W09: 10:00-14:15, maxPositions=2, cadence=24min, entryMin=4.40 (Thu max=4.60), bufferPts=210, Thu/Fri only, flatten=0
  ZE/W12: 08:20-10:05, maxPositions=6, entryMin=5.70, bufferPts=150, layerGap=360, minLayerSec=480, maxAge=180min, maxAdverse=1250, flatten=0
  impulseCloseMult=0.72, impulseCloseMinProfit=0.60, equityProtection=48%
  All zones: flatten=0 — no forced session-end exits on recovering groups
  FridayNightBlock=true — no new first-position entries Friday 22:00+ (weekend gap control)
  RetryCloseGate — failed close attempts during market-closed windows suppressed 60s

TUNING GUIDE

Key parameters and recommended ranges:
- InpSpread: 60-140 for GOLD feeds.
- InpLotsFixedBalance: 300-1000. Default 500 = 0.01 per 500 balance.
- InpT1TargetPoints: 65-110. EntryMin 4.5-5.5. LayerGap 190-280.
- InpT6ScoreMin: 5.5-6.5. Below 5.5 risks over-firing on London open.
- InpT6MinLayerPoints: 280-480. InpT6MinLayerSeconds: 360-600.
- InpT6MaxAdversePoints: 1000-1500. Tighter than BUY zones.
- InpFlattenMinutes (all zones): Keep 0.
- InpAllowContinuationLayer: Keep false.
- InpFastCloseAtrMultiplier: 0.60-1.00. InpFastCloseMinProfitMoney: 0.40-1.20.
- InpT2S03ScoreMin: 4.8-5.5. InpT2S04ScoreMin: 3.8-4.8.
- InpT5CadenceMinutes: 18-36. InpT5ScoreMin: 4.0-4.6.
- InpEquityProtectionPercent: 42-55.
